          <summary>What exactly is included in a routine clean?</summary>
          <div class="answer"><p>Trash and shredder bins, floors, washrooms, pantry, workstations, glass and high-touch surfaces, plus restocking of dispensers and watering of indoor plants. The full written checklist is on our <a href="#/services" data-anchor="checklist">Services page</a>, and your final scope is confirmed in the quotation.</p></div>
        </details>

