          <summary>Do you supply the cleaning materials and consumables?</summary>
          <div class="answer"><p>We bring our own equipment and cleaning materials. Consumables such as toilet paper, hand soap and paper towel can either be supplied by us or bought by you and replenished by our team — whichever you prefer. We will price both ways.</p></div>
