          <summary>Do you handle disinfecting and fogging?</summary>
          <div class="answer"><p>Yes. Disinfecting of high-touch surfaces is part of routine cleaning. Whole-premises fogging is a separate service, usually scheduled after hours or over a weekend so no working day is lost.</p></div>
        </details>

