          <summary>How often should office carpet be shampooed?</summary>
          <div class="answer"><p>Once or twice a year for most offices, more often in high-traffic reception areas. We use extraction equipment that removes soil and neutralises odour from the fibre, and we time the job so the carpet is dry before your team returns.</p></div>
